      "oanoAttmName": "“贸工联动”制造业专班工作方案(征求意见稿).docx",
      "oanoContent": "<p>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 47px; -ms-text-autospace: ideograph-numeric;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><span style=\"font-family: 方正小标宋简体; font-size: 29px;\"><span style=\"font-family: 方正小标宋简体;\">关于征求《</span></span><span style=\"font-family: 方正小标宋简体; font-size: 29px;\"><span style=\"font-family: 方正小标宋简体;\">“贸工联动”制造业专班工作方案</span></span></span></p><p style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 47px; -ms-text-autospace: ideograph-numeric;\"><span style=\"font-family: 方正小标宋简体; font-size: 29px;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: 方正小标宋简体;\">（征求意见稿）》意见的函</span></span></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-family: 方正小标宋简体; font-size: 21px;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">&nbsp;</span></span></p><p style=\"text-align: left; line-height: 40px; -ms-text-autospace: ideograph-numeric;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体_GB2312; font-size: 21px;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: 宋体_GB2312;\">各相关单位：</span></span></p><p style=\"text-align: left; line-height: 40px; text-indent: 43px; -ms-text-autospace: ideograph-numeric;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体_GB2312; font-size: 21px;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体_GB2312;\">为贯彻落实市委、市政府关于</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体_GB2312;\">“贸工联动”工作的部署，全力推动“贸工联动”制造业招商工作，我局草拟了《“贸工联动”制造业专班工作方案（征求意见稿）》。现征求你们意见，请于1月19日下班前将修改意见盖章后以PDF扫描件形式通过浙政钉反馈我局，无意见也请反馈。</span></span></span></p><p style=\"text-align: left; line-height: 40px; text-indent: 43px; -ms-text-autospace: ideograph-numeric;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体_GB2312; font-size: 21px;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体_GB2312;\">联系人：王澜，</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体_GB2312;\">18267913225（浙政钉同号），374225。</span></span></span></p><p style=\"text-align: left; line-height: 40px; text-indent: 43px; -ms-text-autospace: ideograph-numeric;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体_GB2312; font-size: 21px;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">&nbsp;</span></span></p><p style=\"text-align: left; line-height: 40px; text-indent: 43px; -ms-text-autospace: ideograph-numeric;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体_GB2312; font-size: 21px;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体_GB2312;\">附件：</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体_GB2312;\">“贸工联动”制造业专班工作方案（征求意见稿）</span></span></span></p><p style=\"text-align: left; line-height: 40px; text-indent: 43px; -ms-text-autospace: ideograph-numeric;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体_GB2312; font-size: 21px;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">&nbsp;</span></span></p><p style=\"text-align: left; line-height: 40px; text-indent: 43px; -ms-text-autospace: ideograph-numeric;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体_GB2312; font-size: 21px;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">&nbsp;</span></span></p><p style=\"text-align: right; line-height: 40px; text-indent: 43px; -ms-text-autospace: ideograph-numeric;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体_GB2312; font-size: 21px;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: 宋体_GB2312;\">义乌市经济和信息化局</span></span></p><p style=\"text-align: right; line-height: 40px; text-indent: 43px; -ms-text-autospace: ideograph-numeric; -ms-word-break: break-all;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体_GB2312; font-size: 21px;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: 宋体_GB2312;\">2026年1月19日 </span></span></p><p></p>",
